WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Follow the rain down the roof and into the gutter.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
The screen catches leaves and lets the water through.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:19.000
The first runoff carries roof dust. It fills the upright pipe.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:26.000
A ball rises and seals the pipe. Later runoff flows into the covered tank.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:34.000
When the tank fills, water overflows into a tree basin, well away from the wall.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:42.000
After the rain, empty the upright pipe so it can catch the next dusty runoff.
